<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on CMC Magnetics.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on CMC Magnetics.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 25 million American-style call warrants, on CMC Magnetics Corp, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$39.00		  PREMIUM	17.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$ 6.786		 GEARING	5.75 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   09.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	21.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  NT$39.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
